**/._*
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# Local settings and credentials
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/hosts.local
**/hosts.local.*
**/.aws
**/.ssh
